OL,3,GNEWSABuyer found for shopping centre
OL,4,Aafter value drops
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prospective buyer has been found for
OL,7,Fa publicly owned shopping centre in
OL,8,FSurrey.
OL,10,FA council subcommittee is due to
OL,11,Fconsider proposals for the sale of
OL,12,FElmsleigh Shopping Centre in
OL,13,FStaines-upon-Thames on Monday.
OL,15,FThe local authority purchased the
OL,16,Fcentre in 2020 but it made a loss in
OL,17,F2025-26 and has "seen a significant
OL,18,Ffall in value since acquisition",
OL,19,Faccording to a Spelthorne Borough
OL,20,FCouncil document.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
