OL,3,GNEWSABuyer found for shopping centre
OL,4,Aafter value drops
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council declined to comment.
OL,7,FOfficials are recommending the full
OL,8,Fcouncil approves the sale when the
OL,9,Fproposal is put before it in December.
